{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"bow","model_identifier":"bow","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## bow\n\nRanged weapon, wood.\n\n- Cubes: 8 (0 rotated). Texture 64x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.6..0.6, y -0.9..3.0, z -26.5..26.5 (size 1.2 x 3.9 x 53.0 u = 3 x 11 x 149 cm).\nSimple self bow, about 1.5 m (53 u) tip to tip. Held in **slot_hand_l**: grip at the origin, limbs along Z, string on the +Y side so it faces the archer when the bow is raised (same layout as warrior_base `bow`); the limbs step toward the string to the tips.\n"},"description":"## bow\n\nRanged weapon, wood.\n\n- Cubes: 8 (0 rotated). Texture 64x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.6..0.6, y -0.9..3.0, z -26.5..26.5 (size 1.2 x 3.9 x 53.0 u = 3 x 11 x 149 cm).\nSimple self bow, about 1.5 m (53 u) tip to tip. Held in **slot_hand_l**: grip at the origin, limbs along Z, string on the +Y side so it faces the archer when the bow is raised (same layout as warrior_base `bow`); the limbs step toward the string to the tips.\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"grip","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.6,-0.9,-3.0],"to":[0.6,0.9,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[12,52,13.2,53.8],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,52,6.0,53.8],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[14,52,15.2,53.8],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[6,52,12.0,53.8],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[14,0,15.2,6.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[16,0,17.2,6.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"3f1d675a-9efd-55e0-881f-78828ca520ca"},{"name":"limb_up","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.55,-0.25,-13.0],"to":[0.55,0.95000000000